      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Vast Worker demo\n\nA plain SDXL text-to-image workflow. Nothing in it is specific to Vast.ai.\n\n1. Open the **Vast Worker** tab in the sidebar and switch **Run on** to **Vast.ai**.\n2. Press **Run** and confirm the machine.\n\nYou do not need the model on your computer: its download link is stored in the *Load Checkpoint* node, so the 6.9 GB file is fetched on the rented machine.\n\nNeeds about 12 GB of VRAM and a **Disk** setting of 40 GB or more."
      ],
